# Which style each block of a whole RPG Maker A2 sheet gets (decision D27). One row per block; one authority.
#   BLOCK | <Sheet name> | <block 0..31, row-major, 8 across> | <style file name without .pdl, next to this file>
# Every A2 block is a floor-type autotile in RPG Maker (even pits, frames and fences), so the 48-shape floor table is valid for all 32.
# Styles were chosen by eye from the four sheets on 2026-11-05: green = grass, foliage, vines; sand = dirt, wood, warm carpet; stone = rock, ice, tile, pits, smoke, lava.
BLOCK | Outside_A2 | 0 | tearit-green
